    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="3a669152-361b-5bab-ac48-8ffe8cd969fd" activityNameId="fd8a7aa1-65ef-5bfb-89a0-06739e5b5e30" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hydrogen supply, distributed by truck, produced by Electrolysis, SOEC with steam input using electricity from grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hydrogen supply, distributed by truck, produced by Electrolysis, SOEC with steam input using electricity from grid
This dataset represents the supply of 1 kilogram of hydrogen. The hydrogen is distributed by truck over 250 km to the regional storage (Geological cavity) and transported another 250 km to the consumer.  The hydrogen is produced by  Electrolysis, SOEC with steam input, with electricity from grid as feedstock. Transmission loss [% output]: 0.03%. Regional storage loss [% output]: 0.69.  For more information, refer to: Sacchi, R. and Bauer, C. LCA of Power-to-X processes and applications in the residential sector. Paul Scherrer Institut, 2023. Source: Sacchi, R. and Bauer, C. LCA of Power-to-X processes and applications in the residential sector. Paul Scherrer Institut, 2023.

 UUID: f5c107ae-cdf1-33d0-9dbc-a23b3ec76b94
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: Sampling procedure: Literature data
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: 
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f5c107ae-cdf1-33d0-9dbc-a23b3ec76b94.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
